Object.assign(window.BODY=window.BODY||{},{"q114": "<h3 id=\"例114-辛亥日-天黑了-贼照不出来-天将\">【例114】辛亥日 · 天黑了、贼照不出来 <code>天将</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：太阳照武格(二) · 辛亥日第十二局夜占(亥将戌时)，干上亥盗神乘玄武、戌时太阳归地下</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>辛亥日</strong>夜里(戌时)来占失盗(和入门课&quot;太阳照武·贼败露&quot;正好对照)。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"ex\">癸　父母　天后</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"ex\">妻财　贵人　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"ex\">妻财　螣蛇　空亡</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>丑 → 寅 → 卯</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>辛</strong>；干上 <strong>亥</strong>(盗神乘玄武)，夜占(戌时)。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先找玄武(贼)</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：占失盗看玄武(盗贼遗失之神)。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：这盘干上<strong>亥乘玄武</strong>——盗神当头，东西被偷。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　太阳本能照破贼、但要看时辰</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：入门课学过&quot;太阳照武&quot;——玄武撞上太阳(月将)就败露。但太阳灵不灵，还得看<strong>是白天占还是夜里占</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：这盘玄武亥上确有太阳(亥将)，可关键是<strong>占的是戌时(夜)</strong>——太阳已经西沉、归到地下去了。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　断</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：太阳落山，照不出贼。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：原文&quot;虽是太阳照武、奈何戌时太阳归地下、其贼难获&quot;。<strong>同是太阳照武，昼占贼败露、夜占贼难获</strong>——白天占才灵。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：夜占难获(贼难捉)</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 玄武＝贼　② 玄武坐太阳(月将)本可照破　③ 但要昼占、太阳当空才灵　④ 夜占太阳西沉＝贼难获(与入门课昼占贼败露正相反)</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·太阳照武格(二)</p>\n<hr>", "q115": "<h3 id=\"例115-己酉日-一看就知道他为丢东西来-旬空-天将-课体\">【例115】己酉日 · 一看就知道他为丢东西来 <code>旬空</code> <code>天将</code> <code>课体</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：鬼脱乘元格 · 己酉日第七局(返吟昼占·卯加酉)，初末卯木日鬼空亡乘玄武</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>己酉日</strong>白天来占，还没说占什么。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">己</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"ex\">官鬼　玄武　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"ex\">己　子孙　六合</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"ex\">官鬼　玄武　空亡</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>卯 → 酉 → 卯</strong>(返吟)，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>己</strong>；发用 <strong>卯</strong>(日鬼、乘玄武、空亡)。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先看发用乘什么</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：占事有时先&quot;看来意&quot;(问的人为何而来)。窍门是看发用当头的是什么。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：看发用——<strong>卯木</strong>是己土的鬼(木克土)；而且卯乘<strong>玄武</strong>(盗贼遗失之神)。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　鬼＋玄武＝失脱之意</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：发用是&quot;鬼&quot;(麻烦)又乘&quot;玄武&quot;(盗贼遗失)，两样凑一起当头，就是失脱的来意。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：原文&quot;日鬼或脱气乘玄武、来意占失脱&quot;——不用他开口，盘已显出：这人多半是为<strong>丢了东西、被偷被骗</strong>来占的。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　再看空亡</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：失物之神空，物就无踪。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：发用卯又<strong>空亡</strong>——失物虚而无踪、一时难寻。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：来意占失脱(且难寻)</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 发用乘什么可看&quot;来意&quot;　② 鬼＋玄武当头＝为失脱而来　③ 不待开口、盘先显来意　④ 发用空＝物无踪难寻</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·鬼脱乘元格</p>\n<hr>", "q116": "<h3 id=\"例116-甲午日-被人连哄带骗地脱走-天将\">【例116】甲午日 · 被人连哄带骗地脱走 <code>天将</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：脱盗格 · 甲午日第九局昼占，午加甲、三传火局、支来盗干</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>甲午日</strong>白天来占失物/被骗。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"ex\">壬　兄弟　天后</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"ex\">甲　子孙　白虎</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"ex\">戊　妻财　六合</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>寅 → 午 → 戌</strong>(合火局)，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>甲</strong>；干上 午。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　失物还有一种：被&quot;脱&quot;</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：丢东西除了被偷(玄武)，还有一种是被&quot;<strong>脱</strong>&quot;——<strong>我生的那个五行(我生者)</strong>会泄走我的气，像被人连哄带骗、套走了东西。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：甲是<strong>木</strong>，木生<strong>火</strong>，火就是泄我(脱我)的。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　这盘满盘火在脱我</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：看盘里泄我的火多不多、旺不旺。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：三传 寅午戌合成<strong>火局</strong>，加上日支午火，一片火都在泄甲木的气——<strong>我的财物被一层层套走、脱走</strong>。原文&quot;支来盗干、尤其虚诈&quot;。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　断</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：脱主虚诈。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：被脱＝被人虚言巧语哄骗、套走财物，尤其要防虚诈之人。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：尤其虚诈(被哄骗套走)</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 失物有&quot;被偷(玄武)&quot;、也有&quot;被脱(套走)&quot;　② 我生者泄我气＝脱　③ 满盘火局脱甲木＝财物被套走　④ 脱主虚诈、防花言巧语哄骗</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·脱盗格</p>\n<hr>", "q117": "<h3 id=\"例117-庚子日-脱了还脱-层层虚诈-天将\">【例117】庚子日 · 脱了还脱、层层虚诈 <code>天将</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：脱上脱格 · 庚子日第九局夜占，三传申子辰水局脱庚、脱上又脱</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>庚子日</strong>来占(占失物/交易怕受骗)。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">庚</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄申</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"ex\">父母　玄武　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"ex\">丙　兄弟　螣蛇</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"ex\">庚　子孙　青龙</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>辰 → 申 → 子</strong>(合水局)，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>庚</strong>；干上 <strong>子</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先认&quot;脱&quot;</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：丢东西除了被偷(玄武)，还有被&quot;<strong>脱</strong>&quot;——我生的五行(我生者)泄我的气，像被套走。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：庚是<strong>金</strong>，金生<strong>水</strong>，水就是脱庚的。干上<strong>子水</strong>、三传申子辰<strong>水局</strong>——满盘水在泄庚金，东西被脱走。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　脱上又逢脱</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：脱不止一层——干上是脱、三传又是一片脱，脱的上头叠着脱，叫&quot;脱上脱&quot;。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：干上子水脱我，三传水局再脱——<strong>脱上叠脱</strong>，像被人一骗再骗、层层套走。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　断</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：层层脱＝层层虚诈。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：原文&quot;虚诈不实&quot;——防受骗上当、财物一层层被套走。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：虚诈不实(防一骗再骗)</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 庚金生水、水为脱(泄我)　② 干上脱、三传又脱＝脱上脱　③ 脱上逢脱＝层层虚诈　④ 防一骗再骗、财物层层被套</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·脱上脱格</p>\n<hr>", "q118": "<h3 id=\"例118-丁未日-钱像流水接连耗-抓不住-课体\">【例118】丁未日 · 钱像流水接连耗、抓不住 <code>课体</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：无依脱耗格 · 丁未日第七局返吟昼占，三传中末皆丑、脱耗无依</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>丁未日</strong>来占(财物接连耗损)。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丁</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"ex\">乙　兄弟　天空</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"ex\">癸　子孙　太阴</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"ex\">癸　子孙　太阴</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>巳 → 丑 → 丑</strong>(返吟，中末都是丑)，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>丁</strong>；干上 丑。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先认脱</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：丁是<strong>火</strong>，火生<strong>土</strong>，土是脱丁的(泄我)。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：干上丑土、三传丑土——<strong>土在泄丁火</strong>，财物被脱耗。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　返吟＋中末皆同＝无依</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：这是<strong>返吟</strong>课(来去往复、颠倒不定)，而且<strong>中传、末传都是丑</strong>——事情颠来倒去、落点还重复。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：像钱一直往外流、抓不住个准头，叫&quot;<strong>无依脱耗</strong>&quot;。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　断</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：脱又无依＝留不住。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：脱耗接连、无所依傍——财物接连耗损、留不住，难有着落。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：接连脱耗、无依(留不住)</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 丁火生土、土为脱　② 返吟主往复、中末皆同＝无依　③ 脱又无依＝财接连耗损　④ 留不住、难有着落</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·无依脱耗格</p>\n<hr>", "q119": "<h3 id=\"例119-辛卯日-脱了又落空-竹篮打水-旬空-天将\">【例119】辛卯日 · 脱了又落空、竹篮打水 <code>旬空</code> <code>天将</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：脱空格 · 辛卯日第十一局昼占，干上子脱气乘天空</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>辛卯日</strong>来占失物/谋财。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"ex\">癸　官鬼　天后</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"ex\">父母　螣蛇　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"ex\">乙　兄弟　六合</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>巳 → 未 → 酉</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>辛</strong>；干上 <strong>子</strong>(脱气、乘天空)。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先认脱</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：辛是<strong>金</strong>，金生<strong>水</strong>，水为脱(泄辛)。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：干上坐着<strong>子水</strong>——正是脱辛金的气。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　脱又乘&quot;天空&quot;</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：更虚的是——这脱气子水还乘着<strong>天空</strong>(天将，五行属土，主虚诈、落空、无实)。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：脱本已泄我，再乘天空，等于<strong>泄出去的还是个空</strong>——竹篮打水一场空。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　断</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：脱空＝终归落空。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：脱空＝无中生有、终归落空。财物追之无实、谋之成空，别指望有实惠。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：无中生有、终成空</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 辛金生水、水为脱　② 脱气又乘天空(虚诈落空)　③ 脱空＝泄出去还是空　④ 追之无实、竹篮打水</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·脱空格</p>\n<hr>", "q120": "<h3 id=\"例120-辛卯日-报信全是虚的-别空欢喜-无中生有-旬空-天将-课体\">【例120】辛卯日 · 报信全是虚的、别空欢喜(无中生有) <code>旬空</code> <code>天将</code> <code>课体</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：脱空格 · 辛卯日第十一局昼占，干上子乘天空、又逢遥克与空亡(无中生有·虚不实)</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>辛卯日</strong>昼占丢的东西——有人来报信说有下落，可信吗？</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"ex\">癸　官鬼　天后</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"ex\">父母　螣蛇　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"ex\">乙　兄弟　六合</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>巳 → 未 → 酉</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>辛</strong>(金)；干上 <strong>子</strong>(乘天空)、中传未旬空。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　占失物先掂量&quot;消息&quot;实不实</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：占丢东西，常有人来报信(&quot;看见了&quot;&quot;找着了&quot;)。先看这盘的消息是实是虚、可不可信。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：看干上坐什么、乘什么将——这里最能看出&quot;虚实&quot;。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　干上又脱又空、乘的还是&quot;天空&quot;</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：干上的字若是日干泄出去的&quot;<strong>脱气</strong>&quot;(往外漏)、又乘&quot;<strong>天空</strong>&quot;(土将、主虚诈不实)，就是虚象。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：干上<strong>子</strong>(水)是辛金生出去的<strong>脱气</strong>(金生水＝往外漏)、还乘着<strong>天空</strong>(土、主虚诈)；再加初传遥克日干、中传落空——从上到下<strong>全是虚的</strong>，叫&quot;脱空格&quot;。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　断</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：脱空＝无中生有。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：消息全是虚的、不足取信——有人报说看见了、找着了，多半空口无凭、竹篮打水，别轻信、白欢喜一场。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：无中生有、消息不足信</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 占失物先看报来的消息实不实　② 干上脱气＋乘天空(虚诈)＋遥克＋空亡＝脱空格　③ 脱空＝无中生有、全无实象　④ 报信多是虚的、别轻信白欢喜</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·脱空格</p>\n<hr>", "q121": "<h3 id=\"例121-乙亥日-玄武乘空-旬空-天将\">【例121】⭐ 乙亥日 · 玄武乘空 <code>旬空</code> <code>天将</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：陷空乘玄格 · 乙亥日第三局昼占，初传酉空乘玄武发用（人宅失盗）</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>乙亥日</strong>白天来占：东西不见了，是丢了还是被偷、找不找得回？</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"ex\">官鬼　玄武　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"ex\">癸　妻财　白虎</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"ex\">辛　子孙　青龙</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>酉 → 未 → 巳</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>乙</strong>；初传（发用）是 <strong>酉</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　占失物先看谁 —— 取用神</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：占丢东西、被盗，第一个要找的是&quot;<strong>玄武</strong>&quot;。玄武是十二天将里的<strong>盗贼、遗失、阴私之神</strong>（北方水，主阴暗隐秘）。玄武动、玄武发用，多半就是失脱之象。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：所以先在盘里找玄武落在哪、乘的什么。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　这盘玄武当头</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：玄武若发用（在初传），失脱之象就坐实了。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：看初传（发用）<strong>酉，正乘着玄武</strong>——盗贼之神一上来就当头发用，原文断&quot;占事定主失脱&quot;，东西确实是丢了／被偷了。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　玄武又落空</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：玄武再看空不空——空亡（求财篇学过），就是没影、抓不住。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：这酉 <strong>还是旬空</strong>（乙亥属甲戌旬、空申酉）。玄武乘空，主<strong>贼与物都虚而无踪、一时没影</strong>，追回不易。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：人宅失盗（东西确失、追回不易）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 占失物取用神＝玄武（盗贼/遗失之神）　② 玄武发用＝失脱之象　③ 玄武乘空＝贼物无踪难追　④ 玄武是天将、盘上直接能看到</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《大六壬通解》中册·陷空乘玄格</p>\n<hr>", "q122": "<h3 id=\"例122-甲子日-丢的是钱财-旬空-天将-类神\">【例122】⭐ 甲子日 · 丢的是钱财 <code>旬空</code> <code>天将</code> <code>类神</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：财空乘元格 · 甲子日第三局昼占，戌加子、戌为日财空亡乘玄武发用（应防失脱）</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>甲子日</strong>白天来占失物：丢的是什么、能不能追回？</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"ex\">妻财　玄武　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"ex\">壬　官鬼　白虎</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"ex\">庚　子孙　青龙</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>戌 → 申 → 午</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>甲</strong>；初传（发用）是 <strong>戌</strong>、加在日支子上。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先找玄武</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：占失物看玄武（盗贼遗失之神），先看它发用没有。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：这盘发用 <strong>戌乘玄武</strong>——又是失脱之象，东西丢了。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　看玄武&quot;乘什么&quot; ＝ 丢什么</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：光知道丢了不够，还想知道<strong>丢的是什么</strong>。窍门：看<strong>玄武脚下乘的是哪一类神</strong>——乘财就是丢财、乘文书就是丢文书……</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：甲是木、木克土为财，这戌正是 <strong>土、是甲的财</strong>——玄武乘着&quot;财&quot;，所以<strong>丢的是钱财、值钱的东西</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　财又空、难追回</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：再看这财空不空。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：偏偏这戌财 <strong>也旬空</strong>（甲子旬空戌亥）。财乘玄武又空，主<strong>钱财已失、且一时追不回</strong>，原文&quot;应防失脱&quot;。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：应防失脱（丢的是财物、追回不易）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 玄武乘什么＝丢的是什么　② 玄武乘财＝丢钱财　③ 用神（财）空＝难追回　④ 占失物：先玄武定&quot;失&quot;、再看它乘的类神定&quot;失什么&quot;</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《大六壬通解》中册·财空乘元格</p>\n<hr>", "q123": "<h3 id=\"例123-壬申日-贼露原形-天将-课体\">【例123】⭐ 壬申日 · 贼露原形 <code>天将</code> <code>课体</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：太阳照武格（一）· 壬申日第七局返吟，十月占月将寅，支上寅乘玄武、寅为月将照破玄武（家贼败露·昼占）</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>壬申日</strong>白天来占失盗：这贼捉得到吗？（与前两例相反，这次有戏）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">壬</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄亥</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"ex\">丙　子孙　玄武</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"ex\">壬　父母　六合</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"ex\">丙　子孙　玄武</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>寅 → 申 → 寅</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>壬</strong>；日支上乘玄武的是 <strong>寅</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先找玄武（贼）</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：占失盗看玄武。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：这盘支上 <strong>寅乘玄武</strong>，又是盗贼之象——家里有人作贼、东西被偷。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　玄武最怕&quot;太阳&quot;</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：玄武是<strong>极阴之神</strong>，喜暗怕明、专在黑处藏身。而&quot;<strong>太阳</strong>&quot;就是当月的<strong>月将</strong>，光照天下。玄武一旦撞在太阳（月将）上，就像<strong>贼在大白天被聚光灯照住、无处躲藏</strong>——原文&quot;盗贼无处藏身、占贼必败&quot;。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：所以看到玄武，还要看它有没有撞上月将（太阳）。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　这盘正是太阳照贼</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：月将（太阳）压住玄武，又逢白天占，贼形毕露。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：十月占，月将是 <strong>寅</strong>；而乘玄武的偏偏就是这个寅——<strong>玄武正撞在太阳上、被照破了</strong>。又是<strong>白天占</strong>（太阳当空），贼形毕露、藏不住。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：盗贼现形（贼必败露、可以追回）（吉）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 玄武＝贼、喜暗怕明　② 太阳＝当月月将、主光明　③ 玄武坐太阳（月将）＝贼被照破、败露　④ 昼占太阳当空更验、能追回</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《大六壬通解》中册·太阳照武格（一）</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote class=\"star\"><p>⭐ <strong>以下出自《大六壬通解》下册<q class=\"yw\">历代六壬课例</q></strong>——出处可按页码逐句回查，盘为复算并与原书三传交叉验证过。</p></blockquote>", "q124": "<h3 id=\"例124-辛巳日-贼有五人-住在东北五十里-丙丁日败露-天将-类神-应期-课体\">【例124】⭐ 辛巳日 · 贼有五人、住在东北五十里、丙丁日败露 <code>天将</code> <code>类神</code> <code>应期</code> <code>课体</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：元首课 · 辛巳日卯将未时 · 三传午寅戌成炎上火局，玄武乘酉加丑入墓</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：元圣九年闰九月，李都尉家被贼从后花园潜入偷走金银，<strong>辛巳日</strong>未时请元轸占：<strong>贼是谁、在哪、几时能拿住</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>带出</strong>：玄武临处定方位 / ⭐ 玄武到阴神隔几辰＝几人 / 两字之数相乘＝距离 / 克玄武之五行当令＝捕获日</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"ex\">壬　官鬼　贵人</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"ex\">戊　妻财　勾陈</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"ex\">甲　父母　太常</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>玄武乘酉加丑</strong>（入墓）；玄武的<strong>阴神是巳乘螣蛇</strong>；<strong>三传</strong> <strong>午 → 寅 → 戌</strong>合成<strong>寅午戌火局</strong>，正克玄武那一片金。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　⭐ 过了十日，还是看玄武临处——方位就在那</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：与上一例同一条法：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>经旬只于玄武临处责之</strong></q>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：玄武临<strong>丑</strong> ⇒ 断在<strong>东北方</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　⭐ 人数：从玄武数到它的阴神，隔几位就是几人</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：这是本例最独特的一手：<strong>玄武临处 → 玄武阴神</strong>，两者之间<strong>相隔几辰，就是几个人</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：玄武临丑、其阴神在<strong>酉</strong>，<strong>从丑至酉为五辰</strong> ⇒ 断<strong>贼有五人</strong>。后查实：邻妇夫妻子等<strong>共五人</strong>作贼。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　距离与住处：用两字之数，看有没有入墓</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：距离取<strong>类神之数相乘</strong>；住处看那个字是不是<strong>墓</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<strong>酉四、丑八</strong>，四八相乘 ⇒ <q class=\"yw\"><strong>不出五十里</strong></q>；<strong>酉金临丑墓</strong> ⇒ 断住在<strong>坟墓间</strong>。（后果在城东北苏相公坟后拿获。）</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第④步　贼是什么人：把玄武所乘之字的象读全</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<strong>酉为婢女</strong>；金临墓地则年岁不轻；支上<strong>巳酉丑三合金局</strong>说明不是一个人干的、且以酉为核心。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：⇒ 断为<strong>年近五旬、婢女出身的妇人</strong>领头，且<strong>一目有疾</strong>（酉主目、临墓）。后果然<q class=\"yw\">其妇果患目也</q>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第⑤步　⭐ 几时拿得住：拿能克玄武的那一行的日子</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：捕获的应期，取<strong>能克住贼神的五行当令之日</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：三传<strong>寅午戌火局</strong>克玄武所在的<strong>金</strong> ⇒ 断<strong>丙丁日</strong>必败露；玄武阴神<strong>巳火乘螣蛇</strong>，巳为双女 ⇒ 断<strong>两个穿绯衣的妇人</strong>；<q class=\"yw\">火本无体，因木而发</q>⇒ <strong>因负薪（柴火）人而败</strong>。后于<strong>丁巳日</strong>午间，果有两妇穿红裙负薪而来，拿获。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>原文</strong>：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>经旬只于玄武临处责之</strong>，今玄武临丑，故言东北，武之阴神酉，<strong>从丑至酉为五辰，故云五人</strong>……酉丑相乘四八之数，故不出五十里，酉金临丑墓，故云伏坟所。炎上火局又被阴神巳火所克，故<strong>丙丁日必败露</strong>。巳为双女，乘蛇，故云两妇穿绯衣服。<strong>火本无体，因木而发，故因负薪人而败</strong>。</q></p>\n<p><strong>合起来看</strong>：玄武临丑（东北）＋丑到酉五辰（五人）＋酉临丑墓（住坟间、婢女出身）＋火局克金局（丙丁日败露）——</p>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：贼五人，为首是年近五旬、婢女出身、一目有疾的妇人，住东北五十里坟间；丙丁日败露，线索是两个穿红衣、背柴的妇人</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 玄武临处＝方位（过旬也一样）　② ⭐ 玄武到其阴神隔几辰＝几个人　③ 两字之数相乘＝距离；临墓＝住坟边　④ 克玄武的五行当令之日＝捕获应期　⑤ 象要读全：巳为双、乘蛇、因木而发</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>《大六壬通解》下册 · 第六章 历代六壬课例 · 例九（元轸占李都尉家被盗，《玉连环》）<span class=\"src\">〔通解下 p62｜PDF p794〕</span></p>\n<hr>", "q125": "<h3 id=\"例125-甲戌日-丢的是人参-还说得出两个来客穿什么颜色-取象-天将-六亲-类神\">【例125】甲戌日 · 丢的是人参，还说得出两个来客穿什么颜色 <code>取象</code> <code>天将</code> <code>六亲</code> <code>类神</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：比用课 · 甲戌日巳将辰时 · 三传辰巳午顺行泄体，发用辰为日财乘六合</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：己巳年酉月<strong>甲戌日</strong>辰时，友人在寓所<strong>丢了二两人参</strong>，来占。</p>\n<p><strong>带出</strong>：脱气＝失物 / ⭐ 发用即贼身 / 颜色按五行本色取 / 共象锁定具体物件</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"ex\">庚　妻财　六合</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"ex\">辛　子孙　勾陈</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"ex\">壬　子孙　青龙</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>发用辰</strong>是<strong>甲木的财</strong>，乘<strong>六合</strong>；<strong>三传</strong> <strong>辰 → 巳 → 午</strong>，一路<strong>泄日干之气</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　凡是脱气，就是失物</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>凡脱气皆为失物</strong></q>——三传若一路泄日干，本身就是<q class=\"yw\">东西往外走</q>的象。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：三传辰巳午，木生火、火乡泄体 ⇒ <strong>失物破耗</strong>之象成立。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　⭐ 发用就是<q class=\"yw\">拿走它的人</q></strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：占失脱有一条极省事的口径：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>发用即贼之身</strong></q>。发用乘什么天将、是什么五行，就直接读那个人。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：发用<strong>辰乘六合</strong>，<strong>六合为朋友之象</strong> ⇒ 断与<strong>朋友（来客）</strong>有关，连姓氏也可由辰取。后友人自陈：今早确有二人来过。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　衣服颜色也从字上取</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：颜色按五行本色取，再看<strong>这个字坐在什么上面</strong>做叠色。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<strong>辰土</strong> ⇒ 一人穿<strong>土黄衣</strong>；<strong>木临土</strong> ⇒ 一人穿<strong>栗色衣</strong>。友人说<q class=\"yw\">今早来者所穿衣不差</q>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第④步　丢的是什么东西：财 + 天医 + 形状象</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：物件靠<strong>多重象叠</strong>：财定它值钱，天医定它是药，六合带木定它有须有分枝。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：发用为<strong>财</strong>又作<strong>六合</strong>（乃有手足之物、须发分支）；<strong>巳午旺气生天医</strong> ⇒ 是<strong>药材</strong>；合起来 ⇒ <q class=\"yw\">非<strong>人参</strong>而何</q>。⭐ 这就是共象：三条线交叉指到同一件东西上。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>原文</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">盖<strong>凡脱气皆为失物，发用即贼之身</strong>，六合乃朋友之象，辰之姓又可知也。其衣黄者，辰土。栗色者，木临土也。发用为财作六合，乃有手足之物，<strong>巳午旺气生天医，非人参而何</strong>？</q></p>\n<p><strong>合起来看</strong>：三传泄体（东西往外走）＋发用乘六合（朋友所为）＋辰土与木临土（两人衣色）＋财·天医·六合带木三线交叉（人参）——</p>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：是今早来过的两位友人所为（一穿土黄、一穿栗色）；丢的是人参</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 三传泄体＝失物　② ⭐ 发用即贼身　③ 颜色按五行本色＋所临叠色　④ 物件靠多重象交叉（财＋天医＋六合带木＝人参）</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>《大六壬通解》下册 · 第六章 历代六壬课例 · 例十五（王牧夫占失脱，《牧夫占验》）<span class=\"src\">〔通解下 p66｜PDF p798〕</span></p>\n<hr>", "q126": "<h3 id=\"例126-丙午日-申为猴-酉为玉-丢的是什么盘上直接写着-类神-天将-取象-课体\">【例126】丙午日 · 申为猴、酉为玉，丢的是什么盘上直接写着 <code>类神</code> <code>天将</code> <code>取象</code> <code>课体</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：遥克课 · 酉将申时 · 三传申酉戌，四课自宅上连茹而入，末传戌为火库</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：鲍家丢了一只<strong>玉猴</strong>（玉雕的猴子），乙丑年三月二十一日<strong>申时</strong>来占：谁拿的、还找不找得回。&lt;br&gt;⚠️ <strong>参数推定</strong>：原书<strong>未记日干支</strong>。按其自述的三传申酉戌、酉将申时，以及断语里的<q class=\"yw\"><strong>干上午</strong></q>反推，十干十二支中唯一相符的是<strong>丙午日</strong>（丙寄巳，巳上正是午），盘按丙午排——<strong>此为推定，非原书明文</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>带出</strong>：⭐ 类神入传则必详析 / 物件从字面取象（申猴·酉玉）/ 四课连茹入传＝里应外合 / 财归火库＝还能转换回来</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"ex\">戊　妻财　六合</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"ex\">己　妻财　朱雀</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"ex\">庚　子孙　螣蛇</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>申 → 酉 → 戌</strong>；四课自宅上<strong>午未申酉戌连茹</strong>而入；末传<strong>戌</strong>是丙（午）的<strong>火库</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　丢的东西，盘上常常直接写着</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：占失物先找<strong>类神</strong>。物件的类神就照<strong>字的本象</strong>取，不必绕：申即猴，酉即玉、也主金玉之器。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<strong>初传申为猴、次传酉为玉</strong> ⇒ <q class=\"yw\">明现此象</q>，玉猴这件东西自己跳出来了。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　谁拿的：别急着认发用，先看谁乘着凶将</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>发用即贼身</strong></q>是常法，但<strong>本例原书特意反对照搬</strong>：末传戌为奴、乘<strong>螣蛇</strong>，才是真正下手的人。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">人末传之火库戌，<strong>戌为奴作螣蛇，是奴仆盗去无疑，不必指初传为盗也</strong></q> ⇒ 是<strong>家里的奴仆</strong>。⭐ 同一条法则，遇到更明确的象要让位——这就是<q class=\"yw\">共象优先</q>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　怎么走的：四课连茹入传＋六合为交易</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：四课<strong>自宅位一路连茹进三传</strong>，是东西从家里被一层层挪出去；<strong>六合主交易</strong>，说明不是藏起来而是出手了。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：四课午未申酉戌连茹，其中<strong>未土乘勾陈却不备</strong> ⇒ 家里奴仆<strong>里勾外连、移动财物</strong>；申为传送、其上<strong>六合为交易</strong> ⇒ 东西被<strong>变卖成现钱</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第④步　能不能找回：看财最后归到谁的库里</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：失物能否回来，看<strong>类神/财最终落到哪个字</strong>——归到日干自己的库，就有回来的路。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：三传申酉戌，<strong>财归于火库戌</strong>（丙午的库）、又被火库所克 ⇒ 断<strong>必可得也</strong>；日干上午又能制类神。⭐ 后来果然在<strong>次年从汉口卖货处</strong>寻回——正应了<q class=\"yw\">先被变卖、再由财转换归库</q>这条链。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>原文</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">支加干，已出外矣。初传申为猴，次传酉为玉，明现此象，而人末传之火库戌，<strong>戌为奴作螣蛇，是奴仆盗去无疑，不必指初传为盗也</strong>。考酉为太阳而临申金上，干上午又制类神，<strong>必可得也</strong>。</q></p>\n<p><strong>合起来看</strong>：申为猴·酉为玉（丢的东西明现）＋戌为奴乘螣蛇（家仆所盗）＋四课连茹入传·申上六合（里应外合并已变卖）＋财终归丙午火库又受制（还能得回）——</p>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：是家里奴仆盗去、已变卖出手；但财终归本库，日后仍可寻回（次年果于汉口卖货处得之）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 物件类神照字面取（申猴酉玉）　② <q class=\"yw\">发用即贼身</q>不是死规矩，有更明确的象要让位　③ 连茹入传＝里应外合；六合＝变卖交易　④ 财归日干之库＝有归还之路</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>《大六壬通解》下册 · 第六章 历代六壬课例 · 例一（鲍宅失玉猴）<span class=\"src\">〔通解下 p71｜PDF p803〕</span></p>\n<hr>", "q127": "<h3 id=\"例127-丁亥日-午为马乘白虎-马被虎吃了-类神-天将-刑冲破害-应期\">【例127】⭐ 丁亥日 · 午为马乘白虎，马被虎吃了 <code>类神</code> <code>天将</code> <code>刑冲破害</code> <code>应期</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：重审课 · 丁亥日戌将卯时 · 午为马乘白虎加亥发用，初中空亡，末传申临丑墓</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：王寺丞占：<strong>派出去饶州取马的人，为什么还没回来</strong>。<strong>丁亥日</strong>卯时。</p>\n<p><strong>带出</strong>：⭐《心镜》牛马放牧歌诀 / 类神乘什么天将＝出了什么事 / 自刑加自刑 / 四课交车虚合＝消息未到</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丁</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"ex\">兄弟　白虎　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"ex\">己　子孙　朱雀</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"ex\">甲　妻财　玄武</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>午为马</strong>，乘<strong>白虎</strong>加在<strong>亥</strong>上发用；<strong>三传</strong> <strong>午 → 丑 → 申</strong>，初中<strong>空亡</strong>，末传<strong>申临丑墓</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先背下这条歌诀：占牲口看什么</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：《大六壬心镜》：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>牛马放时忌所在，胜光大吉主何方。东西南北看临处，神将相生不损伤。下之克上凌拘系，不克何忧被绊缰。</strong></q>——<strong>胜光（午）为马、大吉（丑）为牛</strong>，看它临在何方、所乘天将与它<strong>相生则不伤</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：本课马的类神<strong>午</strong>乘的是<strong>白虎</strong> ⇒ 神将不相生、反主凶伤，先定<q class=\"yw\">马有损</q>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　凶到什么程度：白虎乘的是马本身</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：白虎主伤、主血光。<strong>它直接乘在类神上</strong>，不是旁边路过，那就是这个东西本身出事。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<strong>午（马）乘白虎加亥发用</strong>，且<strong>午亥皆自刑之地</strong>——<q class=\"yw\"><strong>自刑加自刑</strong></q>，上面的午又被亥所克 ⇒ 断<strong>马必被虎伤死</strong>。五日后果报：马在山上吃草，被虎所食。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　破财的旁证：末传财乘玄武又入墓</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：断完主体，再看<strong>财</strong>这条线，能印证损失。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：末传<strong>申为财、乘玄武</strong>，又<strong>临丑墓</strong> ⇒ 财入墓、被玄武劫 ⇒ <strong>马死破财</strong>之象成立。初中两传又空 ⇒ 事已成空。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第④步　⭐ 为什么占的时候还不知道：四课交车虚合</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：消息什么时候到，看四课之间的<strong>合</strong>什么时候被<strong>冲开</strong>——合住时消息壅塞，冲开才见分晓。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：四课<strong>交车虚合</strong> ⇒ 占时消息未到；到<strong>五日后的巳日</strong>，<strong>巳冲亥、巳上子冲午</strong>，破去四课之合，又与朱雀丑成<strong>巳酉丑</strong>（朱雀主音信） ⇒ <strong>这一日知道马的死讯</strong>。同时日上寅、末传申与巳凑成<strong>寅巳申三刑</strong>，刑则伤财，与破财相印证。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>原文</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">其马必被虎伤死矣。五日后兵士报曰：放马山上吃草，被虎所食。盖<strong>午为马，乘虎加亥为用，自刑加自刑，上午被亥克</strong>，故然。</q>&lt;br&gt;叶注：<q class=\"yw\">《大六壬心镜》有云：『<strong>牛马放时忌所在，胜光大吉主何方。东西南北看临处，神将相生不损伤。</strong>』这段断法即本例断法之根源。</q></p>\n<p><strong>合起来看</strong>：午为马乘白虎（神将不相生·主伤）＋午加亥自刑加自刑又受克（必死）＋末传申财乘玄武临丑墓（破财）＋四课交车虚合待巳日冲破（五日后得讯）——</p>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：马已被虎咬死；消息五日后（巳日）才到</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 占牲口先记《心镜》歌诀：午为马、丑为牛，看临处与神将是否相生　② 白虎直接乘类神＝这东西本身出事　③ 财乘玄武入墓＝破财　④ ⭐ 四课的合几时被冲开，消息几时到</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>《大六壬通解》下册 · 第六章 历代六壬课例 · 例二（邵彦和占取马未回）<span class=\"src\">〔通解下 p75｜PDF p807〕</span></p>\n<hr>", "q128": "<h3 id=\"例128-壬午日-马的类神根本不在课传里-所以找不回-类神-课体-取象\">【例128】⭐ 壬午日 · 马的类神根本不在课传里，所以找不回 <code>类神</code> <code>课体</code> <code>取象</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：元首课 · 壬午日丑将卯时 · 三传寅子戌，午（马）不入课传，午加申</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：遂安官人占<strong>丢失的马</strong>。十一月朔<strong>壬午日</strong>卯时。&lt;br&gt;⚠️ 叶注考证：邵彦和所处年限内，十一月初一并无壬午日（有壬子日），<strong>原书日辰恐有误</strong>，照录备考。</p>\n<p><strong>带出</strong>：⭐ 类神不入课传＝找不回（与例127、129 正好对照）/ 类神所加之字断去向</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">壬</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄亥</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"ex\">戊　子孙　六合</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"ex\">丙　兄弟　青龙</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"ex\">甲　官鬼　白虎</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>午为马</strong>——但<strong>午既不在四课、也不在三传</strong>；盘上<strong>午加在申</strong>上。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　⭐ 占失物、走失，第一眼看类神在不在课传里</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：这是<strong>一条能立刻定生死的判据</strong>：类神<strong>入课传</strong>（尤其临日辰、发用而不空），事情还有着落；<strong>类神不入课传</strong>，就是<q class=\"yw\">不见了</q>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：本课<strong>午（马）不入课传</strong> ⇒ 邵彦和一句话断定：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>此马不见矣</strong></q>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　再看类神加在什么字上，读它的去向</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：类神虽不入传，它在天地盘上总有个位置。<strong>它加临的那个字</strong>就说明它此刻在哪、在做什么。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<strong>午加申</strong>，申为<strong>传送、道路</strong> ⇒ <q class=\"yw\"><strong>道路之上正行也</strong></q>——马正被人牵着/骑着在路上走 ⇒ 断<strong>被人骑去了</strong>。果然不见。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　三例连起来看，这一条判据就立住了</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<strong>例127</strong>：午入传、乘白虎 ⇒ 有下落，且知道是怎么没的。&lt;br&gt;<strong>例129</strong>：酉入传、临日上 ⇒ 在家附近，甚至能说出压在什么器物下。&lt;br&gt;<strong>本例</strong>：午不入课传 ⇒ 不必细推，直接断不见。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：⭐ 所以占失物的顺序永远是：<strong>先找类神 → 看它入不入课传 → 再看它临何字、乘何将</strong>。顺序反了就会在一堆天将里绕远路。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>原文</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">午为马，<strong>不入课传，此马不见矣</strong>。午加申，道路之上正行也。被人骑去矣。果然不见。</q></p>\n<p><strong>合起来看</strong>：午为马而不入课传（此马不见）＋午加申为传送道路（正在路上被人骑走）——</p>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：马找不回来了；此刻正被人骑在路上</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① ⭐ 类神不入课传＝不见（最快的一条判据）　② 类神所加之字＝它现在的处境（申＝道路）　③ 与例127、129 对照记：入传看怎么了，不入传直接断不见</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>《大六壬通解》下册 · 第六章 历代六壬课例 · 例三（邵彦和占遂安官人失马）<span class=\"src\">〔通解下 p75｜PDF p807〕</span></p>\n<hr>", "q129": "<h3 id=\"例129-辛亥日-鸡就在邻居家-还压在瓦盆底下-类神-天将-刑冲破害-取象\">【例129】⭐ 辛亥日 · 鸡就在邻居家，还压在瓦盆底下 <code>类神</code> <code>天将</code> <code>刑冲破害</code> <code>取象</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：元首课 · 辛亥日子将丑时 · 三传戌酉申连茹，酉（鸡）临日上、被戌逼退，白虎临酉</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：十二月<strong>辛亥日</strong>丑时，占<strong>丢的鸡</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>带出</strong>：⭐ 动物走失：类神临日辰或发用而不空则可寻 / 相邻之字＝邻居 / 白虎临类神＝已死 / 天空为瓦器</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"ex\">庚　父母　太常</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"ex\">己　兄弟　白虎</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"ex\">戊　兄弟　天空</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>酉为鸡</strong>，正在<strong>日上</strong>；发用<strong>戌</strong>（阳刃）紧挨着酉；<strong>三传</strong> <strong>戌 → 酉 → 申</strong> 一片金气；<strong>申为白虎本家</strong>，临于酉上、乘<strong>天空</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先按判据看还能不能找</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：叶注给了通则：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>动物走失，首先看类神是否入课传，一般类神临日辰或发用而不空，皆可寻。</strong></q></li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<strong>酉（鸡）临日上</strong>、不空 ⇒ 属<q class=\"yw\">可寻</q>一类，而且<strong>在家附近</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　为什么回不了家：被紧挨的字逼退</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：鸡要归的是<strong>宅</strong>（日支亥）。看它与宅之间隔着什么、被什么害着。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：支上<strong>戌土</strong>与酉<strong>相害相隔</strong>，且<strong>戌发用</strong>、三传连茹<strong>戌逼退酉</strong> ⇒ 正是<strong>狗（戌）撵鸡（酉）</strong>之象 ⇒ 鸡回不了家，被赶到别处。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　到了谁家：相邻之字就是邻居</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">邻</q>这个概念在盘上就是<strong>位置相邻</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<strong>酉与戌相邻</strong> ⇒ 断进了<strong>邻近人家</strong>；中末两传与日相比为<strong>兄弟</strong> ⇒ 也是<q class=\"yw\">邻里同辈</q>的象。发用<strong>戌</strong>取<strong>地位低下之人</strong> ⇒ 断是<strong>邻家的下人（奴）</strong>捉去。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第④步　⭐ 死没死、现在在哪：白虎与天空各说一句</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<strong>白虎临类神</strong>＝已遭杀；<strong>申是白虎的本家</strong>，临在酉上更是<q class=\"yw\">宰割</q>；再看它<strong>乘什么天将</strong>，就知道此刻被放在什么东西里——<strong>天空为瓦器</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：酉上<strong>临白虎</strong>、又见<strong>申（白虎本家）</strong> ⇒ <q class=\"yw\">如何得活</q>，鸡<strong>已被杀</strong>；三传一片金气（肃杀）印证之；<strong>乘天空为瓦器</strong> ⇒ 断此刻<strong>覆在瓦盆之下、尚未下锅</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>原文</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">鸡寻不见矣。被犬冲入邻家，一奴便捉去杀而食之矣。盖戌为用，奴偷也。<strong>邻近人家者，酉与戌邻故也</strong>。酉为鸡，虽类神入传加日主，主自归，奈何加戌阳刃杀上，酉为刃作虎，申亦是虎，如何得活。<strong>盖申为白虎之本家，临于酉上，亦为宰割，乘天空为瓦器，此时覆在瓦盆之下，尚未烹饪耳。</strong></q></p>\n<p><strong>合起来看</strong>：酉为鸡临日上不空（在家附近·本可寻）＋戌发用相害逼退（狗撵鸡·回不了家）＋酉戌相邻（进了邻家）＋戌为下人（奴捉去）＋酉临白虎又见申（已杀）＋乘天空为瓦器（覆在瓦盆下）——</p>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：鸡被狗撵进邻家，被邻家一个下人捉去杀了；此刻还盖在瓦盆底下没下锅</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 动物走失：类神临日辰／发用而不空则可寻　② 被相害相隔之字逼退＝回不了家　③ 位置相邻＝邻居　④ ⭐ 白虎临类神＝已死；乘什么天将＝此刻装在什么器物里</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>《大六壬通解》下册 · 第六章 历代六壬课例 · 例九（邵彦和占失鸡）<span class=\"src\">〔通解下 p78｜PDF p810〕</span></p>\n<hr>"});